{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MeasurementObservation.TorsionKnotFlow","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MeasurementObservation.TorsionKnotFlow","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic","lean:module:QOU.KnotTheory"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.intrinsicAngularMomentum","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.intrinsicAngularMomentum","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/measurement-observation/torsion-knot-flow.lean#L61-L67","doc":"Intrinsic angular momentum of a knot type, proportional to crossing\nnumber: `ω_K = c(K) · 2π`.  Archimedean specialisation over `ℝ`\n(AGENTS.md §7c) — the `2π` factor is genuinely real-valued, so this\nobservable lands in `ℝ` rather than the combinatorial ground ring `R_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BundleState.particles","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BundleState.particles","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/measurement-observation/torsion-knot-flow.lean#L54-L54","doc":"Current particle states. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BundleState.time","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BundleState.time","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/measurement-observation/torsion-knot-flow.lean#L52-L52","doc":"Current time. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BundleState.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BundleState.mk","kind":"ctor","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf05